  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "COCO",
  "description": "MS COCO is a large-scale object detection, segmentation, and captioning dataset.\nCOCO has several features: Object segmentation, Recognition in context, Superpixel stuff segmentation, 330K images (>200K labeled), 1.5 million object instances, 80 object categories, 91 stuff categories, 5 captions per image, 250,000 people with keypoints.",
